    "now": "In five places, two parts of the dashboard server each need the other in order to start. It works, but only because they happen to load in the right order. If a later change shuffles that order, the server could fail to start, or a sign-in check could run before it is ready.\n\nSeparately, the description of what the Mac and Windows bars show is kept inside the web-address code, so an unrelated web change could break the bars.\n\nYou won't see any change in the app either way. This is upkeep.",
