      "key": "B",
      "label": "Move the shared pieces into files that already exist, and add a check",
      "gets": "The five circles are gone, and an automatic check stops new ones. Nothing in the app changes.",
      "costs": "About 2 to 4 hours of agent time. Around 8 files and 150 lines move; no logic is rewritten. The sign-in tests run to prove nothing moved."
